[{"id":178267983,"discussion_id":"6c5c17ee343cad5014db4594c4c403529b941cd5","body":"Thanks for your pull-request.\nThe full list of commands accepted by me can be found at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/robot/robot%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97.md#-%E5%A6%82%E9%9C%80%E4%BA%86%E8%A7%A3%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E7%9A%84%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%E5%8F%AF%E5%8F%82%E8%80%83%E4%B8%8B%E6%96%B9%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E8%A1%A8%E6%A0%BC)。\nYou can get sig-info at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/community/blob/master/CANN/sigs/ops-nn/sig-info.yaml)\n\n\n---\n\n## PR Approval Progress\n\n✅ **Congratulations! All modules have met the lgtm and approve requirements.**\n\n### Module Approval Details\n\n| module | lgtm status | approve status |\n|------|-----------|--------------|\n| pooling | ✅ [*陈琦*](https://gitcode.com/chenqi317), [*刘闯*](https://gitcode.com/liuchuangdev) (2/2) | ✅ [*陈琦*](https://gitcode.com/chenqi317), [*刘闯*](https://gitcode.com/liuchuangdev) (2/1) |\n\n> \uD83D\uDCA1 Tip:\n> - **Committer** can comment `/approve` or `/lgtm`\n> - Commenting `/approve` implies both code review (lgtm) and intent to merge (approve)\n\n------\n\n## CLA Signature Pass  \n klein8793, thanks for your pull request. All authors of the commits have signed the CLA. :+1:","created_at":"2026-07-02T16:54:41+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-06T11:16:31+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":178293958,"discussion_id":"06be9f4cd2b89dbef947b4deda408b96e9beb4c6","body":"#### 变更摘要\n\n此 PR 修复了 `avg_pool` 算子中当 `divisorOverride` 为负数时计算逻辑错误的问题。原代码仅在 `divisorOverride > 0` 时才使用该值作为除数计算 `mulsFactor_`，导致传入负数值（通常作为特殊标志）时错误地进入 else 分支，使用了不正确的池化窗口尺寸进行平均。修改后将条件由 `> 0` 改为非零判断，使负数 `divisorOverride` 也能正确参与 `1.0f / divisorOverride` 的计算。\n\n**主要改动**\n\n- **`avg_pool_big_kernel.h` 中条件判断修正**: 将 `CalcKernelSize` 函数中的 `if (tilingData_->divisorOverride > 0)` 改为 `if (tilingData_->divisorOverride)`，使非零的 `divisorOverride`（包括负数）均能作为有效除数参与 `mulsFactor_` 计算。\n- **`avg_pool_big_kernel_nhwc.h` 中条件判断修正**: 对 NHWC 布局下的 `CalcKernelSize` 函数做了相同的条件变更，保持两个内核实现行为一致。\n\n","created_at":"2026-07-02T18:37:56+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-02T18:37:56+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":178296342,"discussion_id":"ac3f10e786c60d8a1ca8116b13ee669587c9a97e","body":"#### 代码审查\n\n✅ 未发现问题\n\n","created_at":"2026-07-02T18:54:36+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-02T18:54:36+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":178302952,"discussion_id":"1c874df83266eecb2ebc47de1a7e18d9362762b2","body":"compile","created_at":"2026-07-02T19:24:02+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-02T19:24:02+08:00","user":{"id":"661e5ec6d8e1c71c981fd791","login":"klein8793","object_id":"661e5ec6d8e1c71c981fd791","name":"klein8793","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/dd/bb/90d6db9b2f502f0d832f0d01aab48b8070dfbf856ad1140f441788cbf6137bf5.png","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/klein8793"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":178303572,"discussion_id":"0d31213c4d307097969012eabc0d443c686a66a4","body":"流水线任务触发成功\n任务链接 [<b><a href='https://www.openlibing.com/apps/pipelineDetail?pipelineId=a59f9587f5e54e438b19e63e4f5546e4&pipelineRu